          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is nano-hydroxyapatite toothpaste safe for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, nano-hydroxyapatite toothpaste is safe for kids. It’s a gentle, fluoride-free option that’s appropriate for daily use. Just be sure to supervise their brushing and use a pea-sized amount to avoid swallowing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15180629016619__e1c2be8a-c503-489a-b63e-982e50c35a28-collapsible_row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of using Boka’s n-Ha toothpaste for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Using nano-hydroxyapatite (n-Ha) toothpaste, like Boka's, offers several benefits for kids:</p><ul><li><strong>Fluoride-Free Formula </strong>– Provides oral care without the use of fluoride</li><li><strong>Mimics Tooth Enamel</strong>: Our proprietary and innovative formula includes Nano-hydroxyapatite (n-Ha) - a biomimetic mineral form of the same ingredient that naturally makes up 97% of your teeth material and 70% of your dentin.</li><li><strong>Helps Remove Surface Stains</strong> – Gently cleans the tooth surface for a polished appearance</li><li><strong>Freshens Breath</strong> – Leaves the mouth feeling clean and refreshed</li><li><strong>Sulfate- & Paraben-Free</strong> – Made without harsh chemicals for a gentle daily routine</li><li><strong>Vegan-Friendly</strong> – Formulated without artificial flavors, and never tested on animals </li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15180629016619__e1c2be8a-c503-489a-b63e-982e50c35a28-collapsible_row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the flavors of Boka toothpaste available for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka Kids' Toothpaste comes in two flavors: <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/orange-cream-n-ha-toothpaste\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Orange Cream</span></a>, <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/watermelon-mint-n-ha-toothpaste\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon Mint</span></a> and <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/strawberry-mango-n-ha-toothpaste\">Strawberry Mango</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "16ab04bf-3b77-4c35-b24e-778a14934e1f": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Boka Kids' Toothpaste safe for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Boka Kids' Toothpaste is safe for kids. It is free of harsh chemicals and is safe for kids to swallow. The toothpaste is also vegan, cruelty-free, and gluten-free.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
